  "content": "<hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📖<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong> 描述</strong></span></span></p><pre><span style=\"font-size:14px\">懶得建造苦力怕農場？你的武器模組需要太多火藥？</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">那麼這就是為你準備的解決方案！！！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">綠寶石科技學院發現了一種利用螢石、燧石和煤炭來精煉火藥的新配方。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組深受 Habilidade_Deus_Ex 製作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craft-gunpowder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Craft gunpowder</a> 啟發，但原作者從未更新 1.12.2 之後的版本。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我也將紅石改為使用螢石，因為螢石較難取得（需要前往地獄，且幸運附魔對其無效）。</span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></pre><hr><pre><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></span></pre><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以下所有配方均為無序合成（材料位置不影響結果）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你也可以用木炭代替煤炭。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8sJvMwj/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mFKXyxw/2.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dL63Cch/3.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0yf2yjn/4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jRgVMXR/5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZKBkYvp/6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/prLCGL0/7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/BBnM0LK/8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">❓<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 我可以將你的模組加入我的模組包嗎？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 當然可以！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 我發現你的程式碼有些問題，該去哪裡回報？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 你可以透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fusers%252f589583302890094600\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 聯絡我</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftjktak1002\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://proxy.spigotmc.org/840d54a073741f1825e817e79fb2a2af2f2c4382?url=https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/61e11d503cc13747866d338b_Button-2.png\" alt=\"Kofi 連結\" width=\"1392\" height=\"218\"></a></span></p>",
